Package: librice0
Architecture: linux-any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ICE (RFC 8445) library, C API of rice-proto and rice-io
 librice implements Interactive Connectivity Establishment (ICE, RFC 8445),
 the way WebRTC peers find a network path to each other, with STUN and TURN.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries librice-proto (the protocol,
 sans I/O) and librice-io (sockets and timers), used by LordOS's build of
 WPE WebKit to run WebRTC's ICE in WebKit's network process.

Package: librice-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: linux-any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: librice0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: ICE (RFC 8445) library, C API of rice-proto and rice-io - development files
 librice implements Interactive Connectivity Establishment (ICE, RFC 8445),
 the way WebRTC peers find a network path to each other, with STUN and TURN.
 .
 This package contains the headers (rice-proto.h, rice-io.h) and the
 pkg-config files (rice-proto, rice-io).
